OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Essex cricketer faces trial on
OL,4,Atwo rape charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Essex cricketer Robin Das has
OL,7,Fappeared in court charged with raping a
OL,8,Fwoman twice in south London.
OL,10,FThe 24-year-old, of Leytonstone, east
OL,11,FLondon, is accused of carrying out the
OL,12,Fsex attacks in Brixton in March 2024.
OL,14,FHe appeared in the dock at Inner London
OL,15,FCrown Court, wearing a navy suit, white
OL,16,Fshirt and dark tie.
OL,18,FJudge Freya Newbury fixed a five-day
OL,19,Ftrial for January 2028.
